 (Information Technology) / BSc (Computer Science) / BE or BTech Computer Science / BE or BTech IT etc / MCA. 0 to 2 Years experience in Software - Customer Success / Support Domain. Experience of working with various databases like SQL, Oracle MS Access or with software implementation ticketing tools will be an added advantage. Good understanding of computer, internet, and IT literacy with the ability to learn new technology quickly. Basic knowledge of SQL / Oracle Database - writing SQL queries to troubleshoot errors Basic knowledge of networking, windows desktop/servers, IIS, and troubleshooting tools Good listening and problem-solving skills Customer service and a customer-centric attitude \n \n Desired Personality Traits \n Soft spoken pleasing, professional, presentable at the same time sharp to handle small and large clients Technically Logically Strong Strong analytic, problem solving Interpersonal Skills Strong work ethic and sense of commitment Ability to balance multiple priorities \n \n Key Result Areas \n Customer Satisfaction of assigned clients Problem query analysis, understanding Solving \n \n Key Performance Indicators \n Prompt, responsive, responsible, and friendly approach to client situations Zero customer complaints Client Feedback \n \n Job Details \n Job Category: Technical Associate Job Type: Full Time Job Location: Ahmedabad, Pune \n\nDisclaimer: This job posting and Location has been aggregated from external source. Role details, content, and availability are subject to change. Applicants are advised to confirm the latest information directly on the company website before applying.\n\nKey Skills: office equipment,oracle,customer success,information technology,inbound,customer complaints,customer service,client visits"},{"title":"Android Developer","company":"Tops Technologies","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-07-07","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-android-developer-tops-technologies-pvt-ltd-ahmedabad-1-to-6-years-0707